<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus tenders for 18,000 T maize.</title>
<headline>Cyprus tenders for 18,000 T maize.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Wednesday invited tenders for the supply of one cargo of 18,000 tonnes of maize, with a shipment date of November or December 1996.</p>
<p>The tender closes on Tuesday November 5, a statement from the Grain Commission said. --Nicosia newsroom 357 2 365089</p>
